<template>
  <div v-loading="pageLoading" class="pit-page">
    <section class="card workflow-card">
      <div class="card-header"><div><strong>个税核对底稿</strong><p>同公司、同所属期唯一底稿；重新计算覆盖自动结果，并保留仍存在记录的人工原因。</p></div><span class="tag" :class="overview?.workpaper?.data_status === 'ready' ? 'tag-success' : 'tag-warning'">{{ overview?.exists ? stageLabel : '未生成' }}</span></div>
      <div class="card-body pit-toolbar"><div><small>上次计算</small><strong>{{ overview?.workpaper?.last_calculated_at || '—' }}</strong></div><el-button type="primary" :loading="recalculateLoading" :disabled="!periodId" @click="recalculate"><el-icon><RefreshRight /></el-icon>{{ overview?.exists ? '重新计算' : '生成本月底稿' }}</el-button></div>
    </section>

    <section class="card workflow-card pit-source-panel">
